1
00:00:00,168 --> 00:00:01,638
Ah!

2
00:00:03,071 --> 00:00:08,241
(Howard:)Okay, I have now officially moved out
of my mother's house.

3
00:00:08,410 --> 00:00:12,010
(Howard:)You are now the only woman in my life
who I'll see naked in the bathroom.

4
00:00:13,081 --> 00:00:15,641
(Bernadette:)I know this wasn't easy. You doing okay?

5
00:00:15,817 --> 00:00:19,087
Well, I'm fine. It's just her I'm worried about.

6
00:00:19,654 --> 00:00:22,814
(Bernadette:)- She'll be okay. She's a grown woman.
- I know.

7
00:00:22,991 --> 00:00:28,051
(Howard:)It's just ever since my dad left,
I've felt responsible for her.

8
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:30,200
(Bernadette:)That's a lot for a kid to deal with.

9
00:00:30,365 --> 00:00:33,095
(Howard:)She was just so sad all the time.

10
00:00:33,301 --> 00:00:36,271
(Howard:)I was the only person
who could cheer her up.

11
00:00:36,438 --> 00:00:38,698
(Howard:)Well, me and Ben and Jerry.

12
00:00:40,108 --> 00:00:42,168
(Bernadette:)She's lucky you were there.

13
00:00:44,079 --> 00:00:47,279
(Howard:)You know, she's why I first got into magic.

14
00:00:47,449 --> 00:00:49,109
(Howard:)I would do little shows for her.

15
00:00:49,317 --> 00:00:54,447
(Howard:)Hang up a bedsheet like it was a curtain,
put on a top hat and cape.

16
00:00:54,623 --> 00:01:00,123
And partway through the act, I would say
I needed a volunteer from the audience...

